    "Mandarin, Cantonese & English Voice · Multilingual Code-Switching · Pinyin, Cangjie, Zhuyin & QWERTY": "Mandarijn, Kantonees & Engels Spraak · Meertalige Code-Switching · Pinyin, Cangjie, Zhuyin & QWERTY",
    "Mandarin, Cantonese, English and mixed multilingual speech keep up effortlessly. Includes Simplified Pinyin, Traditional Cangjie, Zhuyin (Bopomofo) and English QWERTY.": "Mandarijn, Kantonees, Engels en gemengde meertalige spraak worden moeiteloos bijgehouden. Inclusief Vereenvoudigd Pinyin, Traditioneel Cangjie, Zhuyin (Bopomofo) en Engels QWERTY.",
