    "The Super Learning engine gradually picks up your wording, the names you say often and your accent. Everything it learns stays on your own computer.": "Super Learning -moottori oppii vähitellen sanavalintasi, usein sanomasi nimet ja aksenttisi. Kaikki sen oppima pysyy omalla tietokoneellasi.",
