    "Same features as Max. The bottom of the panel shows one line about Remember Me, another app we make. Go opens its App Store page.": "Samme funksjoner som Max. Nederst i panelet vises én linje om Remember Me, en annen app vi lager. Gå åpner App Store-siden dens.",
