    "Same features as Max. The bottom of the panel shows one line about Remember Me, another app we make. Go opens its App Store page.": "Samme funktioner som Max. Nederst i panelet vises én linje om Remember Me, en anden app vi laver. Gå åbner dens App Store-side.",
